            <p props="cpp">This method removes a previously added watermark image from the local video stream based on the specified unique ID.</p>
            <p props="android">This method removes a previously added watermark image from the local video stream using the specified unique ID.</p>
        <p props="ios mac">This method removes a previously added watermark image from the local video stream using the specified unique ID.</p>
